(text "RAILS: DUAL-MONO POL (user rulings 2026-10-12, bom 17(m3)) - every POL LDO sits on the sheet it powers; only the pre-reg entry is on the POWER sheet. This sheet carries the L-channel analog housekeeping LDOs: P15A_L (U909), N15A_L (U910), VEE15_L (U911), VE1_L (U906), P5A_L (U908) - all PG -> PG_ALL. V_ROFF_L LDO is on IV; V33CLK on CLKR; V33FF on XLAT; V33D on CTRL; V33RLY on OUT." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 17.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1edf4c57-f60d-4711-ab6c-7a7c705ed0d2"))
(text "REFERENCE CHAIN (derived req. 6: one filtered node per channel): U901 REF7050 (ONE PER BOARD) -> R902/C904 4.99k + 10u film (3.2 Hz) -> U902A OPA1656 FET buffer = REF5F -> dividers (Susumu RG1608N 0.05 % 10 ppm discretes for V_VG/CASB2/PADB, best-tolerance ruling 2026-10-08; ACAS 0612 matched arrays for VFR/VCM/VREF/VE1) -> OPA1612 unity buffers (10 R + 47u UKL + 1u C0G at the node)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 21.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7a87a7fe-eb68-4982-9e72-966e50c0a47c"))
(text "SINKS/SOURCES: VFR = U904A + Q901 servoed NPN sink (150 mA); VCM = U904B + Q903/Q904 class-A pair on +3V3A/GND (I_q ~40 mA > 24 mA peak, Q905 V_be multiplier); VE1 = U906 LT3045 (bottom strip) (SET driven by U905A x1.44 via VE1_SET_L, from V8P3); VB1 = VE1 - [Q902 2SA1036K diode + 59.0 R] at 10 mA via R929 590 -> U905B buffer (V_eb compensator, 17(k)(d)). CASB2 = U902B servo on mean(mid_p) vs 3.0 V tap (2 x 499k + 1n, C_i 1u, 100 R / 100u, 6.2 V clamp)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 25.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "aa4b3483-2ab5-47a9-b831-a36b99e173df"))
(text "PADB = U907 current servo: A = diff-amp 0.25 x (padb_ep - VEE15) [40.2k/10.0k], B = integrator vs 3.568 V tap -> 1k -> PADB_BASE (Cpadb 100u on CORE), 2.7 V clamp -> I_pad 50 mA independent of VEE15 and Si1555 V_th. Divider set-point errors (E96) are static and inside the 17(i) accuracy columns: V_VG +0.08 %, VREF -0.15 %, VFR -0.14 %, VCM -0.10 %, VE1 +0.14 %, CASB2 tap +0.07 %, PADB -0.2 %. Loops simulated 2026-10-06 (utils/refs_loop.py): VFR f_c 530 Hz / PM 96; VCM f_c 374 kHz / PM 159, -0.33 mV on 23 mA RTZ pulses; PADB f_c 0.38 Hz / PM 103, 55.6 mA start-up peak; VB1 compensator 11x." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 29.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "98869071-4b95-4850-8a57-411e78cff346"))
(text "P16A" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.480 46.990 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e58f0cf8-254d-42c1-b0ca-26e2b8f0ab5b"))
