(text "VCM: feedback from the VCM node (after 2.2 R) - the pair sources/sinks the +-24 mA RTZ-edge current at I_q ~41 mA (Nexperia models, refs_loop vcm: P(Q903) 0.08 W, P(Q904) 0.08 W, PM 160 deg, -0.33 mV on 23 mA pulses). Q905 thermally coupled to Q903/Q904." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 140.000 365.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ad4526af-3e08-42a8-82c6-f6304cd033f4"))
